The FITZ® 8HP Fixed-Base RULER Router has a high-capacity, 60 volt brushless motor rated at 8.5 HP. The built-in LED light makes it easy to see when you are setting speeds and guides with the digital LED display. The adjustable clamp allows it to be used at various depths for a wide variety of projects and materials.The 2-speed variable-speed dial lets the user adjust the angle and depth of the tool. The 8HP variable-speed brushless motor delivers consistent performance and can handle a variety of materials and surfaces. The router’s adjustable depth, depth indicator, and height adjustment make it a versatile tool for woodworking projects. The fixed base on the tool allows it to be used directly on a work surface or on a table. Its built-in LED light and 2-speed variable-speed brushless motor deliver consistent performance and make the tool easy to use.
